														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4828530">
									

<p>Greetings, my real name will be redacted for anonymity purposes; but you can call me Dr. Recoil instead. I joined this site because I wanted to read and write skips, and stories about the SCPverse as well.</p>
<p>I've always have an interest in writing and creating my own fictional world with great themes ever since I was young, and after discovering this modern day - internet equivalent of Lovecraft's works just last year, that interest/another hobby of mine has just grown ten folds.</p>
<p>Since we're already talking about hobbies, I would like to mention that I love playing video games and actual ones as well; such as chess. I also have a amateur-ish skill when it comes to video editing.</p>
<p>I would also like to mention that I am not very flexible with English yet at leas, since I am still a student and from a different country as well. Just a heads up in case someone ask me in the future about any possible mistakes in any of my post in the site (though, I'll certainly make sure that that won't frequently happen in my stories here).</p>
<p>Anyways, that's all I have to say. I am looking forward on working with you guys, and once again, thanks for accepting me.</p>
<p>P.S. The element I chose to associate with myself is <span style="color: grey">Air</span> , due to it being virtually invisible unless it decided to make it's presence known, by either helping you breathe or creating strong winds <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">kinda edgy, I know. but that's the way it is ¯\_(ツ)_/¯</span>. Also for the fact that it can be extremely flexible in finding a way out when contained.</p>

